# CR 106.3a: Snow-Covered Swamp produces snow B, not plain B --
# mana-payment-resolves-snow already proves this for Snow-Covered Plains;
# here for Snow-Covered Swamp, a snow requirement (queue paysnow) rather than a plain one.
# Main phase of turn 1, so the payment is made at a priority (L2 S19).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 B
queue paysnow B
paymanacost human S
